  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5cd2e788ed2fcfd3472860ef2c492a9d70bd6bcb?download\" data-file-name=\"송쌤과학 주기율표 1탄.pdf\" data-file-size=\"473352\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D421%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220405161820&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F5cd2e788ed2fcfd3472860ef2c492a9d70bd6bcb')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">송쌤과학 주기율표 1탄</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">462.26KB</div></div></a></div><p>매일 도움만 받다가 부족한 실력이지만 올려봅니다.</p><p>주기율표를 암기할 수 있는 표를 만들었습니다.</p><p>접는선을 이용하여 접어서 암기할 수 있도록 제작했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>안에있는 QR코드로 연결시 제가 편집한 주기율표송으로 연결되게 만들었습니다.</p><p>선생님들과 학생들에게 도움이 되길 바랍니다^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>주기율표송 링크: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/txJVDnHScTA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/txJVDnHScTA</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=txJVDnHScTA\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/PWW3A/hyNVQA11U1/r2TohAZhPimPmlHFhO4KXk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=462_176_704_440\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/txJVDnHScTA\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
